<https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/sense/entry/DA/tr/_x5f_d_x5f_a_x7e__x7e_h0_x5f_00_x5f_pwg02/11> a ontolex:LexicalSense ;
  skos:definition "11) присвоить, принять на себя, так <ab>v. a.</ab> проявлять, показывать; иметь, обладать,\n[Page3-0904]\nутверждать, придерживаться (мнения); med.: {#varRa^M daDire#}\n<ls>ṚV. 2,34,13.</ls> {#ahi^M jaGa\\nvA~ i^ndra\\ tavi^zImaDatTAH#}\n<ls n=\"ṚV.\">5,32,2.</ls> {#va\\yaM Sa^vizWa\\ vArya^M di\\vi Sravo^ daDImahi#}\n<ls n=\"ṚV. 5,\">35,8.</ls> <ls n=\"ṚV.\">1,149,1.</ls> {#maya^H#}\n<ls n=\"ṚV.\">3,1,3.</ls> {#su\\vIrya^m#}\n<ls n=\"ṚV.\">4,36,6.</ls> {#saha^H#}\n<ls n=\"ṚV.\">5,23,4.</ls> {#vapU^Mzi#}\n<ls n=\"ṚV.\">3,1,8.</ls> {#kzatram#}\n<ls n=\"ṚV. 3,\">38,5.</ls> {#Ayu^H#}\n<ls n=\"ṚV.\">7,80,2.</ls> {#rAyaH syA^ma Da\\ruRa^M Di\\yaDyE^#}\n<ls n=\"ṚV. 7,\">34,34.</ls> {#gi\\rizu\\ kzaya^M daDe#}\n<ls n=\"ṚV.\">9,82,3.</ls> {#yasya^ daDi\\ze pU^rva\\peya^m#}\n<ls n=\"ṚV.\">7,92,1.</ls> {#de\\vEH sa\\raTa\\M daDA^nAH#}\n<ls n=\"ṚV.\">10,15,10.</ls> {#SaSva^to\\ mahyeno\\ daDA^nAn (jaGAna)#} на ком лежит вина\n<ls n=\"ṚV.\">2,12,10.</ls> {#jUrya^tsva\\gnira\\jaro\\ vane\\zvatrA^ daDe a\\mfta^m#}\n<ls n=\"ṚV.\">3,23,1.</ls> — {#nArAyaRo daDe nidrAM brAhmaM varzasahasrakam#} предался сну\n<ls>HARIV. 531.</ls> {#kApAlikamiva vrataM Datte#}\n<ls>PAÑCAT. I,239.</ls> {#raktanetratriSiKAM BfkuwiM daDAnaH#}\n<ls n=\"PAÑCAT.\">85,3.</ls> {#daData iva vilAsaSAlinftyam#}\n<ls>KIR. 5,32.</ls> {#kAcaH kAYcanasaMsargAdDatte mArakatIM dyutim#}\n<ls>HIT. Pr. 41.</ls> {#sa nyastacihnAmapi rAjalakzmIM tejoviSezAnumitAM daDAnaH#}\n<ls>RAGH. 2,7.</ls>\n<ls>AMAR. 23.</ls> {#mAnaM Datsva#}\n<ls n=\"AMAR.\">67.</ls> {#sAMDyaM tejaH pratinavajavApuzparaktaM daDAnaH#}\n<ls>MEGH. 37.</ls>\n<ls>BHARTṚ. 3,82.</ls> {#duHKasya duHKaM Datte suKe suKam#}\n<ls>SĀH. D. 59,15.</ls> {#hfdi SucaM Datte#}\n<ls>RĀJA-TAR. 1,228.</ls> {#Amodam — daDAnaH#}\n<ls>KIR. 5,26.</ls> {#mudam#}\n<ls>VOP. 5,26.</ls> {#SriyaM daDAnA#}\n<ls>BHAṬṬ. 2,1.</ls> <ls n=\"BHAṬṬ.\">4,17.</ls> {#DEryaM cADizatADikam#} (nach den <ab>Scholl.</ab> {#ADizata#})\n<ls n=\"BHAṬṬ.\">7,102.</ls> {#vIryaM cADizatADikam#} (nach den <ab>Scholl.</ab> {#aDizata#})\n<ls n=\"BHAṬṬ.\">15,109.</ls> {#daDAnA baliBaM maDyam#}\n<ls n=\"BHAṬṬ.\">4,16.</ls> {#upakroSaM DAtumAtmanaH#} так <ab>v. a.</ab> навлечь на себя порицание\n<ls>R. 3,62,26.</ls> Также <ab>act.</ab>: {#(kasmAt) SOcacintAM na vA daDuH#}\n<ls>RĀJA-TAR. 5,11.</ls> {#daDati DruvaM kramata eva na tu praTitOjaso 'pi sahasopacayam#}\n<ls>ŚIŚ. 9,29.</ls> {#utsukatAm#} 2. {#parimugDatAm#} 32. {#SitatAm#} 66. {#jvAlASriyaM sAtiSayAm#}\n<ls>BHAṬṬ. 2,2.</ls> {#DeyA DAratvam#}\n<ls n=\"BHAṬṬ.\">19,16.</ls> {#unnasaM daDatI vaktram#}\n<ls n=\"BHAṬṬ.\">4,18.</ls> {#nayanakajjalamiSramaSru — daDatIm#}\n<ls>CAURAP 40.</ls> {#daDatI mAraM BABiH#}\n<ls>NALOD. 1,17.</ls> {#daDadaBraSiraH#}\n<ls>ŚIŚ. 9,3.</ls> {#urojadvayam#}\n<ls n=\"ŚIŚ.\">86.</ls> {#vapuH#}\n<ls n=\"ŚIŚ.\">10.</ls> <ls>KIR. 5,5. 7.</ls> {#dvijihvavadanaM Datte duzwo durjanapannagaH#}\n<ls>KĀM. NĪTIS. 3,20.</ls> Вм. {#aDAyata#} «обладал» в месте: {#(DanuH) etadvarzasahasraM tu brahmA pUrvamaDArayat . tato 'nantaramevATa prajApatiraDAyata ..#}\n<ls>MBH. 4,1347</ls> по всей вероятности следует читать {#aDArayat#}."@ru ;
  pwglex:sourceGloss "<div n=\"1\">— 11) {%sich zu eigen machen, annehmen%} so <ab>v. a.</ab> {%an sich zur Erscheinung bringen, zeigen; inne haben, besitzen,%}\n[Page3-0904]\n{%behaupten, halten%}; med.: {#varRa^M daDire#}\n<ls>ṚV. 2,34,13.</ls> {#ahi^M jaGa\\nvA~ i^ndra\\ tavi^zImaDatTAH#}\n<ls n=\"ṚV.\">5,32,2.</ls> {#va\\yaM Sa^vizWa\\ vArya^M di\\vi Sravo^ daDImahi#}\n<ls n=\"ṚV. 5,\">35,8.</ls> <ls n=\"ṚV.\">1,149,1.</ls> {#maya^H#}\n<ls n=\"ṚV.\">3,1,3.</ls> {#su\\vIrya^m#}\n<ls n=\"ṚV.\">4,36,6.</ls> {#saha^H#}\n<ls n=\"ṚV.\">5,23,4.</ls> {#vapU^Mzi#}\n<ls n=\"ṚV.\">3,1,8.</ls> {#kzatram#}\n<ls n=\"ṚV. 3,\">38,5.</ls> {#Ayu^H#}\n<ls n=\"ṚV.\">7,80,2.</ls> {#rAyaH syA^ma Da\\ruRa^M Di\\yaDyE^#}\n<ls n=\"ṚV. 7,\">34,34.</ls> {#gi\\rizu\\ kzaya^M daDe#}\n<ls n=\"ṚV.\">9,82,3.</ls> {#yasya^ daDi\\ze pU^rva\\peya^m#}\n<ls n=\"ṚV.\">7,92,1.</ls> {#de\\vEH sa\\raTa\\M daDA^nAH#}\n<ls n=\"ṚV.\">10,15,10.</ls> {#SaSva^to\\ mahyeno\\ daDA^nAn (jaGAna)#} {%an welchen Schuld haftet%}\n<ls n=\"ṚV.\">2,12,10.</ls> {#jUrya^tsva\\gnira\\jaro\\ vane\\zvatrA^ daDe a\\mfta^m#}\n<ls n=\"ṚV.\">3,23,1.</ls> — {#nArAyaRo daDe nidrAM brAhmaM varzasahasrakam#} {%gab sich dem Schlafe hin%}\n<ls>HARIV. 531.</ls> {#kApAlikamiva vrataM Datte#}\n<ls>PAÑCAT. I,239.</ls> {#raktanetratriSiKAM BfkuwiM daDAnaH#}\n<ls n=\"PAÑCAT.\">85,3.</ls> {#daData iva vilAsaSAlinftyam#}\n<ls>KIR. 5,32.</ls> {#kAcaH kAYcanasaMsargAdDatte mArakatIM dyutim#}\n<ls>HIT. Pr. 41.</ls> {#sa nyastacihnAmapi rAjalakzmIM tejoviSezAnumitAM daDAnaH#}\n<ls>RAGH. 2,7.</ls>\n<ls>AMAR. 23.</ls> {#mAnaM Datsva#}\n<ls n=\"AMAR.\">67.</ls> {#sAMDyaM tejaH pratinavajavApuzparaktaM daDAnaH#}\n<ls>MEGH. 37.</ls>\n<ls>BHARTṚ. 3,82.</ls> {#duHKasya duHKaM Datte suKe suKam#}\n<ls>SĀH. D. 59,15.</ls> {#hfdi SucaM Datte#}\n<ls>RĀJA-TAR. 1,228.</ls> {#Amodam — daDAnaH#}\n<ls>KIR. 5,26.</ls> {#mudam#}\n<ls>VOP. 5,26.</ls> {#SriyaM daDAnA#}\n<ls>BHAṬṬ. 2,1.</ls> <ls n=\"BHAṬṬ.\">4,17.</ls> {#DEryaM cADizatADikam#} (nach den <ab>Scholl.<