  dct:references <https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/citation/AIT_x2e__x2d_BR_x2e__x2d_8_x2c_7_x2e_>, <https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/citation/AIT_x2e__x2d_BR_x2e__x2d_8_x2c__x2d_13_x2e_>, <https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/citation/K_xc4__x80_TY_x2e__x2d__xc5__x9a_R_x2e__x2d_26_x2c_7_x2c_6_x2e_>, <https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/citation/K_xc4__x80_TY_x2e__x2d__xc5__x9a_R_x2e__x2d_7_x2c_9_x2c_4_x2e_>, <https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/citation/K_xc4__x80_TY_x2e__x2d__xc5__x9a_R_x2e__x2d_9_x2c_7_x2c_4_x2e_>, <https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/citation/P_xc4__x80_R_x2e__x2d_G_xe1__xb9__x9a_HY_x2e__x2d_2_x2c_1_x2e_>, <https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/citation/_xc4__x80__xc5__x9a_V_x2e__x2d_G_xe1__xb9__x9a_HY_x2e__x2d_1_x2c_10_x2e__x2d_11_x2e_>, <https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/citation/_xc5__x9a_AT_x2e__x2d_BR_x2e__x2d_4_x2c_3_x2c_4_x2c_13_x2e_>, <https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/citation/_xc5__x9a_AT_x2e__x2d_BR_x2e__x2d_4_x2c_3_x2c_4_x2c__x2d_4_x2e_> ;
