on/_xe1__xb9__x9a_V_x2e__x2d_1_x2c__x2d_118_x2c_8_x2e_>, <https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/citation/_xe1__xb9__x9a_V_x2e__x2d_2_x2c_20_x2c_8_x2e_>, <https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/citation/_xe1__xb9__x9a_V_x2e__x2d_8_x2c_59_x2c_2_x2e_> ;
